{
  "title": "Sphinx",
  "about": "The Great Sphinx side on in soft clay, for the Dinki Dell doof: lying in the sand, its headdress striped gold and blue, a big sun behind its head and the pyramids small on the horizon. On the beat a ripple of light runs down the stripes and the eye looks round and blinks; through a build the eye glows hotter, and on the drop it fires lasers across the screen.",
